 can <strong>drastically change the pace of the game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet new customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906780/extras/c4033f85c56d0894bcccac50915a3794.poster.avif?t=1761271787\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906780/extras/c4033f85c56d0894bcccac50915a3794.webm?t=1761271787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906780/extras/c4033f85c56d0894bcccac50915a3794.mp4?t=1761271787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beginning, you'll only get one type of customer, the capybara Chase. Over time, though, you'll meet new faces who can give a variety of effects like speeding up all the customers behind, increasing the happiness level of all your food, or buying out your whole menu. If you can make enough money quickly, you might even run into the elusive <strong>golden flamingo</strong>, who can unlock powerful rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock new restaurants</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906780/extras/85dd2e5144d43913d07ba490e3370fc7.poster.avif?t=1761271787\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906780/extras/85dd2e5144d43913d07ba490e3370fc7.webm?t=1761271787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906780/extras/85dd2e5144d43913d07ba490e3370fc7.mp4?t=1761271787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the golden flamingo's rewards is the ability to open up new restaurants, which will have more expensive food, and new effects that can <strong>alter the gameplay</strong>. Some restaurants might have more slots open for food, more choices, or require much faster production in order to run effectively.</p>","developers":["Hurricane Games"],"dlc":[4126240],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906780/60fb7fea480bdb47a98358c277787eb55117cf6d/header.jpg?t=1761271787","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3906780/1303590548/df1c369aa444b1bb79777219fbe0628afb8d5aaa/1761267425/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761268039","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3906780/1303590548/df1c369aa444b1bb79777219fbe0628afb8d5aaa/1761267425/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761268039","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3906780/1303590548/df1c369aa444b1bb79777219fbe0628afb8d5aaa/1761267425/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761268039","id":257221939,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221939/movie480.mp4?t=1761268039","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221939/movie_max.mp4?t=1761268039"},"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257221939/fc604bae974352eb3ecb6353973fe3d4f8c96168/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761268039","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221939/movie480.webm?t=1761268039","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257221939/movie_max.webm?t=1761268039"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3906780/1846004736/1f21c8f3974cb181acb02d01c1347f2109bdaeae/1755142495/dash_