7","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906780/7ab51ea1be999727a2d5a0a30140ea544689a780/ss_7ab51ea1be999727a2d5a0a30140ea544689a780.600x338.jpg?t=1761271787"}],"short_description":"Run your own diner, patisserie, seafood store, and more in this fast-paced incremental game! Keep your customers happy by updating your menu and upgrading a variety of skills.","steam_appid":3906780,"support_info":{"email":"hurricanegames32@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}